<view class="form-section data-v-393d36cf"><view class="section-header data-v-393d36cf"><text class="section-title data-v-393d36cf">流程节点设计</text><text class="section-desc data-v-393d36cf">设计流程的节点和流转路径（可拖拽排序）</text></view><view class="node-designer data-v-393d36cf"><view class="designer-toolbar data-v-393d36cf"><el-button vue-id="2e19e79a-9" type="primary" size="small" icon="el-icon-plus" data-event-opts="{{[['^click',[['addNode']]]]}}" bind:click="__e" class="data-v-393d36cf" bind:__l="__l" vue-slots="{{['default']}}">添加节点</el-button><el-button vue-id="2e19e79a-10" type="success" size="small" icon="el-icon-s-operation" data-event-opts="{{[['^click',[['validateNodeDesign']]]]}}" bind:click="__e" class="data-v-393d36cf" bind:__l="__l" vue-slots="{{['default']}}">验证设计</el-button><el-button vue-id="2e19e79a-11" type="info" size="small" icon="el-icon-question" data-event-opts="{{[['^click',[['showDesignHelp']]]]}}" bind:click="__e" class="data-v-393d36cf" bind:__l="__l" vue-slots="{{['default']}}">设计帮助</el-button></view><block wx:if="{{$root.g0}}"><view class="node-stats data-v-393d36cf"><view class="stat-item data-v-393d36cf"><text class="stat-label data-v-393d36cf">节点总数:</text><text class="stat-value data-v-393d36cf">{{$root.g1}}</text></view><view class="stat-item data-v-393d36cf"><text class="stat-label data-v-393d36cf">开始节点:</text><text class="stat-value data-v-393d36cf">{{startNodeCount}}</text></view><view class="stat-item data-v-393d36cf"><text class="stat-label data-v-393d36cf">结束节点:</text><text class="stat-value data-v-393d36cf">{{endNodeCount}}</text></view><view class="stat-item data-v-393d36cf"><text class="stat-label data-v-393d36cf">任务节点:</text><text class="stat-value data-v-393d36cf">{{taskNodeCount}}</text></view><view class="stat-item data-v-393d36cf"><text class="stat-label data-v-393d36cf">通知节点:</text><text class="stat-value data-v-393d36cf">{{reviewNodeCount}}</text></view></view></block><view class="nodes-container data-v-393d36cf"><block wx:if="{{$root.g2}}"><view class="empty-nodes data-v-393d36cf"><image class="empty-image data-v-393d36cf" src="/static/images/empty-process.png" mode="aspectFit"></image><text class="empty-title data-v-393d36cf">暂无流程节点</text><text class="empty-desc data-v-393d36cf">点击"添加节点"开始设计您的业务流程</text></view></block><block wx:else><draggable bind:input="__e" class="nodes-grid data-v-393d36cf" vue-id="2e19e79a-12" handle=".drag-handle" ghost-class="ghost" animation="300" value="{{form1.data.nodes}}" data-event-opts="{{[['^input',[['__set_model',['$0','nodes','$event',[]],['form1.data']]]]]}}" bind:__l="__l" vue-slots="{{['default']}}"><block wx:for="{{$root.l2}}" wx:for-item="node" wx:for-index="index"><view class="{{['node-item','data-v-393d36cf','node-'+node.$orig.node_type]}}"><view class="node-header data-v-393d36cf"><view class="drag-handle data-v-393d36cf" title="拖动排序"><view class="el-icon-rank _i data-v-393d36cf"></view></view><view class="node-badge data-v-393d36cf"><text class="node-index data-v-393d36cf">{{index+1}}</text></view><view class="node-info data-v-393d36cf"><text class="node-name data-v-393d36cf">{{node.$orig.node_name}}</text><text class="node-key data-v-393d36cf">{{node.$orig.node_key}}</text></view><view class="node-type-tag data-v-393d36cf"><text class="data-v-393d36cf">{{node.m3}}</text></view></view><view class="node-content data-v-393d36cf"><block wx:if="{{node.$orig.assignee_type}}"><view class="node-field data-v-393d36cf"><text class="field-label data-v-393d36cf">负责人:</text><text class="field-value data-v-393d36cf">{{node.m4}}</text></view></block><block wx:if="{{node.$orig.required_approvals}}"><view class="node-field data-v-393d36cf"><text class="field-label data-v-393d36cf">需要同意:</text><text class="field-value data-v-393d36cf">{{node.$orig.required_approvals+"人"}}</text></view></block><block wx:if="{{node.$orig.time_limit}}"><view class="node-field data-v-393d36cf"><text class="field-label data-v-393d36cf">时间限制:</text><text class="field-value data-v-393d36cf">{{node.$orig.time_limit+"小时"}}</text></view></block><block wx:if="{{node.g3}}"><view class="node-field data-v-393d36cf"><text class="field-label data-v-393d36cf">可用操作:</text><view class="actions-tags data-v-393d36cf"><block wx:for="{{node.l0}}" wx:for-item="action" wx:for-index="i" wx:key="i"><text class="action-tag data-v-393d36cf">{{''+action.m5+''}}</text></block></view></view></block><block wx:if="{{node.g4}}"><view class="next-nodes data-v-393d36cf"><text class="next-label data-v-393d36cf">下一节点:</text><view class="next-nodes-list data-v-393d36cf"><block wx:for="{{node.l1}}" wx:for-item="nextNode" wx:for-index="i" wx:key="i"><text class="next-node-item data-v-393d36cf">{{''+nextNode.m6+''}}<block wx:if="{{nextNode.$orig.condition_rule_code}}"><label class="condition-tag _span data-v-393d36cf">条件</label></block><block wx:if="{{nextNode.$orig.default_path}}"><label class="default-tag _span data-v-393d36cf">默认</label></block></text></block></view></view></block></view><view class="node-actions data-v-393d36cf"><el-button vue-id="{{('2e19e79a-13-'+index)+','+('2e19e79a-12')}}" size="mini" icon="el-icon-edit" data-event-opts="{{[['^click',[['editNode',[index]]]]]}}" bind:click="__e" class="data-v-393d36cf" bind:__l="__l" vue-slots="{{['default']}}">编辑</el-button><el-button vue-id="{{('2e19e79a-14-'+index)+','+('2e19e79a-12')}}" size="mini" icon="el-icon-connection" type="primary" data-event-opts="{{[['^click',[['editNodeConnections',[index]]]]]}}" bind:click="__e" class="data-v-393d36cf" bind:__l="__l" vue-slots="{{['default']}}">连接</el-button><el-button vue-id="{{('2e19e79a-15-'+index)+','+('2e19e79a-12')}}" size="mini" icon="el-icon-delete" type="danger" data-event-opts="{{[['^click',[['removeNode',[index]]]]]}}" bind:click="__e" class="data-v-393d36cf" bind:__l="__l" vue-slots="{{['default']}}">删除</el-button></view></view></block></draggable></block></view><block wx:if="{{$root.g5}}"><view class="design-tips data-v-393d36cf"><view class="tips-header data-v-393d36cf"><text class="tips-title data-v-393d36cf">设计提示</text></view><view class="tips-list _ul data-v-393d36cf"><view class="_li data-v-393d36cf">每个流程必须包含且只能包含一个开始节点</view><view class="_li data-v-393d36cf">流程必须包含至少一个结束节点</view><view class="_li data-v-393d36cf">拖拽左侧图标可自由调整节点顺序（请注意同步更新连接）</view><view class="_li data-v-393d36cf">点击"连接"按钮配置节点之间的流转关系</view><view class="_li data-v-393d36cf">可以为节点设置条件分支实现复杂流程</view><view class="_li data-v-393d36cf">通知节点(review)仅用于知悉/确认，不改变流程分支</view><view class="_li data-v-393d36cf">网关节点用于条件路由，不创建任务</view></view></view></block></view></view>